Carried forward from the fees-exact build (def323d) — exact fees before signing:
  - browser-writer.ts : prepareRegisterWithNostr(name, npub, budgetFor?) → PreparedOnsWrite. The fee
                        input is chosen ONCE, dry-run to learn the cost, and the REAL transaction is
                        built and sealed at the caller's budget; submit() sends that envelope, once
                        (no rescan, reselection or rebuild). simulate() dry-runs a twin at the same
                        fee and accepts only when total_fees_required is within it — the dry run
                        itself does not enforce the fee. The estimate reads total_fees_required
                        first. submitRegisterWithNostr and the single-call writes go through prepare.
  - index.ts          : exports the PreparedOnsWrite type.
